{"id":2336,"date":"2024-09-19T12:35:23","date_gmt":"2024-09-19T12:35:23","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2336"},"modified":"2025-10-02T16:23:50","modified_gmt":"2025-10-02T16:23:50","slug":"cardboard-cosmetic-packaging","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/cardboard-cosmetic-packaging\/","title":{"rendered":"Cardboard Cosmetic Packaging"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"220\"><strong data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"218\">Cosmetic Packaging Boxes for Every Market<\/strong><\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"74\" data-end=\"458\">Cosmetic products need packaging that not only protects but also represents your brand clearly. At <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/\"><em data-start=\"173\" data-end=\"195\">Shop Cardboard Boxes<\/em><\/a>, we offer <strong data-start=\"206\" data-end=\"245\">custom cardboard cosmetic packaging<\/strong> designed for skin care, makeup, fragrance, and beauty accessories. Whether you&#8217;re selling in retail stores or shipping to subscription customers, our boxes help present your products in a clean and organized way.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"460\" data-end=\"759\">We provide custom sizes, printing, inserts, and finishing to match your branding needs. You can get cardboard cosmetic packaging boxes with Gloss, Matte, or Spot UV coating, plus embossing, foil stamping, and more. Fast turnaround, low MOQs, and high-quality printing come standard with every order.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"764\" \/>\n<h2 data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"827\">High-Quality Cardboard Cosmetic Packaging for All Products<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"829\" data-end=\"876\">Custom Solutions That Fit Your Product Line<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"878\" data-end=\"1109\">We produce boxes that align with different types of cosmetic products. Whether you&#8217;re launching a new skincare serum or need full sets for lip kits or foundations, we make sure each box is structurally sound and visually appealing.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1337\">\n<li data-start=\"1111\" data-end=\"1169\">\n<p data-start=\"1113\" data-end=\"1169\">Available in tuck-end, sleeve, drawer, and mailer styles<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1170\" data-end=\"1234\">\n<p data-start=\"1172\" data-end=\"1234\">Durable materials that protect contents from heat and pressure<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1235\" data-end=\"1291\">\n<p data-start=\"1237\" data-end=\"1291\">Inserts and compartments for jars, tubes, and palettes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1337\">\n<p data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1337\">Custom window cutouts for display packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1439\">Each box is engineered to hold its shape while maintaining a lightweight design to save on shipping.<\/p>\n<p>You can also explore our complete collection of <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product-category\/cosmetic-and-gift-cardboard-boxes\/\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"4050\" data-end=\"4173\"><strong data-start=\"4051\" data-end=\"4088\">Cosmetic and Gift Cardboard Boxes<\/strong><\/a> to find packaging suited for birthdays, retail promotions, or beauty PR kits.<\/p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1441\" data-end=\"1474\">Printing and Branding Options<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1476\" data-end=\"1651\">We offer multiple printing methods to reflect your brand identity. You can print your logo, color palette, ingredient list, and safety instructions with clarity and sharpness.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1797\">\n<li data-start=\"1653\" data-end=\"1679\">\n<p data-start=\"1655\" data-end=\"1679\">CMYK full-color printing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1722\">\n<p data-start=\"1682\" data-end=\"1722\">PMS color matching for brand consistency<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1764\">\n<p data-start=\"1725\" data-end=\"1764\">High-resolution logo and image printing<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1797\">\n<p data-start=\"1767\" data-end=\"1797\">Inner panel printing available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h2 data-start=\"1804\" data-end=\"1847\">Popular Box Styles in Cosmetic Packaging<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"1849\" data-end=\"1893\">Cosmetic Packaging Boxes Wholesale Range<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"2054\">Our <strong data-start=\"1899\" data-end=\"1937\">cosmetic packaging boxes wholesale<\/strong> program is ideal for startups, private label brands, and established businesses looking to source packaging in bulk.<\/p>\n<ol data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2252\">\n<li data-start=\"2056\" data-end=\"2115\">\n<p data-start=\"2059\" data-end=\"2115\">Custom sizes and die-cut shapes for all cosmetic formats<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2167\">\n<p data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2167\">Low minimum order quantity starting at 100 boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2168\" data-end=\"2211\">\n<p data-start=\"2171\" data-end=\"2211\">Volume-based discounts for larger orders<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"2212\" data-end=\"2252\">\n<p data-start=\"2215\" data-end=\"2252\">Free shipping and free design support<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p data-start=\"2254\" data-end=\"2367\">These boxes are made using durable and eco-friendly paperboard, suitable for both e-commerce and in-store retail.<\/p>\n<hr data-start=\"2369\" data-end=\"2372\" \/>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"sticky end-(--thread-content-margin) h-0 self-end select-none\">\n<div class=\"absolute end-0 flex items-end\">\n<h2 data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"224\">Material and Coating Options<\/h2>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<table class=\"border-borderMain my-[1em] w-full table-auto border\" style=\"height: 530px;\" width=\"842\">\n<thead class=\"bg-offset\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Material Type<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Benefits<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Ideal For<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Finishing Type<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Benefits<\/strong><\/th>\n<th class=\"border-borderMain px-sm py-sm dark:border-borderMainDark break-normal border text-left align-top\"><strong>Best Use Case<\/strong><\/th>\n<\/tr>\n<\/thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">White SBS Board<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Smooth surface, excellent for high-quality printing<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Luxury skincare and premium cosmetic boxes<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Gloss Coating<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Shiny finish, enhances colors, adds vibrancy<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Lip gloss, nail polish, or vibrant products<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Brown Kraft Paperboard<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Eco-friendly, rustic appeal, recyclable<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Organic products and natural cosmetic brands<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Matte Coating<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Smooth, minimal glare, premium appearance<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Skincare or makeup brands seeking a subtle look<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Recycled Cardboard<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Sustainable, cost-effective, durable<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Bulk packaging or budget-friendly product lines<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Spot UV<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Highlights specific design elements<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Brand logos, product names, or limited editions<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Chipboard (Rigid)<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Strong structure, high-end look<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Perfume boxes, gift kits, and magnetic closures<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Foil Stamping<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Metallic finish for luxurious effect<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Gift boxes, perfumes, and high-end skincare<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Corrugated Cardboard<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Crush-resistant, shipping-safe<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Mailer boxes for cosmetics and subscription kits<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Embossing\/Debossing<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Adds texture and depth to logos or text<\/td>\n<td class=\"border-borderMain px-sm dark:border-borderMainDark min-w-[48px] break-normal border\">Premium branding<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"_tableContainer_80l1q_1\">\n<div class=\"_tableWrapper_80l1q_14 group flex w-fit flex-col-reverse\" tabindex=\"-1\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p data-start=\"3088\" data-end=\"3161\">All materials are recyclable and safe for cosmetic contact when required.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3168\" data-end=\"3209\">Use Cases for Cardboard Cosmetic Boxes<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"3211\" data-end=\"3265\">Colored Cardboard Boxes Nearby for Custom Branding<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"3267\" data-end=\"3481\">If you&#8217;re searching for <strong data-start=\"3291\" data-end=\"3325\">colored cardboard boxes nearby<\/strong>, we can deliver full-color printed boxes in your desired shades and tones. Match your product label or season\u2019s theme using Pantone or CMYK color printing.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"3483\" data-end=\"3502\">We can help create:<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3649\">\n<li data-start=\"3504\" data-end=\"3525\">\n<p data-start=\"3506\" data-end=\"3525\">Lip gloss packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3526\" data-end=\"3558\">\n<p data-start=\"3528\" data-end=\"3558\">Serum and dropper bottle boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3591\">\n<p data-start=\"3561\" data-end=\"3591\">Mascara and eyeliner packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3617\">\n<p data-start=\"3594\" data-end=\"3617\">Foundation bottle boxes<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"3618\" data-end=\"3649\">\n<p data-start=\"3620\" data-end=\"3649\">Skincare and beauty gift kits<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"3651\" data-end=\"3745\">Window boxes, magnetic closures, and drawer boxes are available for luxury cosmetic packaging.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"3752\" data-end=\"3789\">Other Products You Might Find Useful<\/h2>\n<p data-start=\"3791\" data-end=\"4000\">For brands that need packaging beyond cosmetics, we also offer themed boxes for events and special campaigns. Our <a href=\"https:\/\/shopcardboardboxes.com\/product\/christmas-cardboard-boxes\/\"><strong data-start=\"3905\" data-end=\"3934\">Christmas cardboard boxes<\/strong><\/a> are ideal for holiday beauty bundles and festive packaging needs.<\/p>\n<h2 data-start=\"4258\" data-end=\"4313\">Luxury Cosmetic Packaging Boxes for Premium Branding<\/h2>\n<h3 data-start=\"4315\" data-end=\"4360\">Stand Out on Shelves or In Delivery Boxes<\/h3>\n<p data-start=\"4362\" data-end=\"4595\">If you&#8217;re selling high-end products, our <strong data-start=\"4403\" data-end=\"4438\">luxury cosmetic packaging boxes<\/strong> can help you compete visually. From gold foil finishes to magnetic enclosures and custom compartments, we\u2019ll build boxes that match the value of your brand.<\/p>\n<ul data-start=\"4597\" data-end=\"4754\">\n<li data-start=\"4597\" data-end=\"4655\">\n<p data-start=\"4599\" data-end=\"4655\">Rigid board and chipboard options for sturdier packaging<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4656\" data-end=\"4700\">\n<p data-start=\"4658\" data-end=\"4700\">Custom closures and ribbon pulls available<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li data-start=\"4701\" data-end=\"4754\">\n<p data-start=\"4703\" data-end=\"4754\">Velvet-lined or coated interiors for added elegance<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p data-start=\"4756\" data-end=\"4827\">Ideal for fragrance, spa kits, luxury skincare, and makeup collections.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"4756\" data-end=\"4827\"><strong data-start=\"4834\" data-end=\"4908\">Need cosmetic boxes that reflect your brand style and packaging goals?<\/strong> Request a custom quote today for <strong data-start=\"4942\" data-end=\"4984\">cardboard cosmetic packaging wholesale<\/strong> orders. We offer low MOQs, free design setup, and quick delivery options to meet your schedule and standards.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Shop Cardboard Boxes for high-quality cosmetic packaging at wholesale prices. Our cardboard boxes are sturdy, recyclable, and customizable to fit your brand&#8217;s unique needs. With custom sizes, styles, and fast turnaround times, we&#8217;re committed to providing exceptional packaging solutions that help your brand stand out. Quote Now.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":2458,"template":"","meta":{"_joinchat":[]},"product_brand":[],"product_cat":[184],"product_tag":[],"class_list":["post-2336","product","type-product","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","product_cat-cosmetic-and-gift-cardboard-boxes","rishi-post","first","instock","shipping-taxable","purchasable","product-type-simple"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v27.9 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Order Custom Cardboard Cosmetic Packaging, Wholesale<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\